{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/809648-2ed-will-slashers-be-without-integrity","id":809648,"title":"[2ED] Will Slashers be without Integrity?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-01-15T09:30:47-08:00","id":809648,"title":"[2ED] Will Slashers be without Integrity?","content":"Watching some <b>X Files</b> episodes, I come to wonder - <b>Should Slashers in Hunter 2ED be without Integrity trait?</b> Many supernaturally charged murderers ( like people killing others with conjured lighting or fire ) in TV series look like characters that started with high Integrity and with each killing, they become more and more unstable. On the other hand - characters like Dexter or Hannibal Lectere points to trope of Slasher being rather stable in their inhumanity. <b>Did 1ED Slashers had Morality trait?</b>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-16T00:21:23-08:00","id":810124,"title":"","content":"Answer: yes or no, depending on the Slasher. Regardless, they ought to have Breaking Points that hunters can suss out and use against them. I've seen Aspirations and Breaking Points described as a character's hopes and fears; and while there's more to them than that, there's some truth to that description.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-16T21:40:29-08:00","id":810487,"title":"","content":"1ED Slashers had morality as an option for slashers. They were always low and all the sins revolved around killing. This allowed someone to play a character like Dexter Morgan, psychologically compelled to kill, but held to a code so that he does become shaken by when he breaks it.<br /> <br /> I hope something like this is brought back as it is an important option, as it highlights an important point. Most of the people Dexter killed had it coming, and barring the fact that he didn't give any of them due process, I didn't really care about it. However Dexter was a very evil person besides the killings in that his reckless behavior ruined the lives of all of his friends and family and really messed up his life. So a killer with a code can be interesting to play as a sympathetic character, but it also shows how living <b>for</b> the sword can bring ruin to yourself and primary relationships. <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8619-aforgeforthoughts","name":"AForgeForThoughts","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"60"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}